      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create presigned_download.py in the current working directory.\nTask: creates a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b977a4080015nuNDG6OJJf59E",
