    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Amazon S3 as the object storage provider. I will now integrate the `boto3` library to interface with the chosen provider, and ensure the provider is properly identified within the script.\n\n\n**Implementing the Script**\n\nI've begun writing the `presigned_download.py` file. I'm focusing on the code using `boto3` to generate the pre-signed URL, which includes importing `boto3` and creating the `s3_client` to handle S3 interactions. The script will need a function that takes the bucket name, object name, and expiration time as parameters and then returns the pre-signed URL.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818025176,
          "start": 1789818022292
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b977a994001snm7L4mDKaj4B8",
      "message_id": "msg_0b977a415001ERF4AcsN3V11QH",
      "session_id": "ses_f46885c07ffeCo86MznOGgdO8I",
      "time_created": 1789818022292,
